      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i ran a describe and it looks like the liveness probe is failing because the app is taking way longer than 30s to bind to the port, but it's definitely trying. i think it's a resource issue though... i saw some spikes in memory usage on the node right before it started looping. how can i tell if it's actually hit a limit or if the node itself is just under pressure?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
